{"quest":{"line_id":"11010532","line_type":"5","order":205,"title":{"cn":"骗子的踪迹","en":"Swindler's Trail","jp":"嘘つきの行方","kr":"사기꾼의 행방"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"102","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"黑嚎氏族","en":"Grimmaw Clan","jp":"ブラックロアー","kr":"블랙하울 부족"},"route":"#/season-1/daily/11010532","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236080"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:2"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_11010532:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236090"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236100"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236110"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236120"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236130"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010532:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236140"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与克鲁格对话","en":"Talk to Kruger","jp":"クルーガーと話す","kr":"크루거와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"黑嚎氏族里似乎出现了一些意外情况，向克鲁格询问一下是否需要帮助吧。","en":"Something unexpected seems to have cropped up within the Grimmaw Clan. Ask Kruger if he needs help.","jp":"ブラックロアーでアクシデントが起きたようだ。クルーガーに協力が必要か尋ねよう。","kr":"블랙하울 부족에 돌발 상황이 생긴 것 같다. 크루거에게 도움이 필요한지 물어보도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"询问赌场老板","en":"Ask the Owner","jp":"オーナーから話を聞く","kr":"불법 전투장 사장에게 묻기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"据说偷走钱袋的赏金猎人经常待在赌场附近，赌场老板很可能对他有印象，过去问问看吧。","en":"It is said that the bounty hunter who stole the pouch often hangs around the vicinity of the betting house. The betting house owner might know something about him. Let's find out.","jp":"巾着を盗んだバウンティハンターはよく賭場の近くにいるそうだ。賭場のオーナーが何か知っているかもしれない。行って聞いてみよう。","kr":"지갑을 훔쳐 간 현상금 사냥꾼이 불법 전투장 근처에 나타난다고 하니, 불법 전투장 사장이 그를 기억하고 있을지도 모른다. 가서 물어보도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"游玩百物牌","en":"Play Cards","jp":"百物集で遊ぶ","kr":"만물 카드 게임하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"为了获得偷走钱袋的赏金猎人的情报，和赌场老板来一局百物牌吧。","en":"Play Century Quest with the betting house owner to gather information about the bounty hunter who stole the pouch.","jp":"巾着を盗んだバウンティハンターの情報を得るために、賭場のオーナーと百物集をしよう。","kr":"지갑을 훔쳐간 현상금 사냥꾼의 정보를 얻기 위해 불법 전투장 사장과 만물 카드를 한 판 해보자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"寻找马弗里克","en":"Find Maverick","jp":"マフリクを探す","kr":"메버릭 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"根据赌场老板所说，偷走钱袋的赏金猎人名叫马弗里克，现在就待在西边的绿洲。前往那里寻找他吧。","en":"According to the betting house owner, the thieving bounty hunter's called Maverick, and he's now staying at the oasis to the west. Let's go find him.","jp":"賭場のオーナーによると、巾着を盗んだバウンティハンターの名前はマフリクといい、今は西のオアシスにいるそうだ。そこへ行って彼を訪ねよう。","kr":"불법 전투장 사장님의 말에 의하면 지갑을 훔쳐 간 현상금 사냥꾼의 이름은 메버릭이라고 한다. 지금 서쪽 오아시스에 있다고 하니 그곳으로 그를 찾으러 가자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"击败马弗里克","en":"Defeat Maverick","jp":"マフリクを撃破する","kr":"메버릭 처치"},"objective_description":{"cn":"偷走钱袋的赏金猎人马弗里克果然就藏在绿洲。击败他，拿回丢失的钱袋！","en":"Maverick is indeed hiding in the oasis. Defeat him and retrieve the lost pouch!","jp":"巾着を盗んだバウンティハンターのマフリクはやはりオアシスに隠れていた。彼を倒して失くした巾着を取り返そう！","kr":"지갑을 훔쳐 간 현상금 사냥꾼 메버릭이 오아시스에 숨어있다. 그를 처치하고 잃어버린 지갑을 되찾도록 하자!"}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"找出钱袋","en":"Find the Pouch","jp":"巾着を探し出す","kr":"지갑 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"从马弗里克的背包里找出黑嚎族人丢失的钱袋。","en":"Find the Grimmaw clansman's pouch in Maverick's bag.","jp":"マフリクのバッグの中から、ブラックロアーの人が失くした巾着を探し出そう。","kr":"메버릭의 가방에서 블랙하울 부족이 잃어버린 지갑을 찾아보자."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"交还钱袋","en":"Return the Pouch","jp":"巾着を渡す","kr":"지갑 돌려주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"返回黑嚎氏族，将找回的钱袋交给克鲁格，让他拿给失主。","en":"Return to the Grimmaw Clan and hand over the pouch to Kruger so that he can return to its owner.","jp":"ブラックロアーのところへ戻り、取り返した巾着をクルーガーに渡して持ち主に返してもらおう。","kr":"블랙하울 부족으로 돌아가 잃어버린 지갑을 크루거에게 건네주고 주인을 찾아주라고 한다."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"11236080","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236080","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236080.asset","raw_sha256":"fe3bb61299b4510a7ba5a73f5b339f853e28991cd74d7b6367a37cd6658a3262","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6222192,"size":1592,"identity":"11010532:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11236090","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236090","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236090.asset","raw_sha256":"62dbf167b985237a98e462803458a1f7df818e3e17e4e69d41524001e35d1578","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6223784,"size":1608,"identity":"11010532:1:2","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11236100","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236100","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236100.asset","raw_sha256":"41db163bd888b6c3285e767a7682b44b3368b38013a884329b6f8dd38069281d","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6225392,"size":1248,"identity":"11010532:1:3","field":"FinishAction"},{"plot":"11236110","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236110","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236110.asset","raw_sha256":"1d2cda0339c120aafbb2944b185dc3b6cb8865d829f27edc23c4c477ef825dfc","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6226640,"size":1312,"identity":"11010532:1:4","field":"ClientFinishActionByMove"},{"plot":"11236120","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236120","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236120.asset","raw_sha256":"b0b43f8459e074f3e6c940366fcd30a5c987ef81d7721c444f1fcd32ea34381a","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6227952,"size":1168,"identity":"11010532:1:5","field":"FinishAction"},{"plot":"11236130